                                                "sense_id": "8a7e3b00-8cac-3e97-b367-0d3a9be8f3b0",
                                                "text": "Harmsworth's Daily Mail had warmongered for over twenty years."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
